{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52419","headline":"回波乐 六十二 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若欲觅佛道，先观五荫好。\n妙宝非外求，黑暗由心造。\n善恶既不二，元来无大小。\n设教显三乘，法门奇浩浩。\n触目即安心，若个非珍宝。\n明识生死因，努力自研考。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}